---
// Clean Canvas - No complex framework components needed
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>San Diego Medical Transport | Coming Soon</title>
	<style>
	body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #1a202c; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f8fafc; }
	main { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }
	
	/* WIP BANNER */
	.wip-banner { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; background-color: #fff9db; border: 1px solid #ffe066; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
	.wip-badge { background-color: #d97706; color: white; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; }
	.wip-banner p { margin: 0; color: #4b3802; font-weight: 500; }

	/* HERO ZONE */
	.hero { background: white; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 2.5rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
	h1 { color: #0044cc; margin-top: 0; font-size: 2.25rem; line-height: 1.2; }
	.lead { font-size: 1.2rem; color: #4a5568; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
	
	/* BUTTONS */
	.cta-group { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
	.btn { display: inline-block; padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; line-height: 1.2; }
	.btn-primary { background-color: #0066cc; color: white; }
	.btn-secondary { border: 2px solid #0066cc; color: #0066cc; }
	
	/* ACCESSIBILITY: KEYBOARD FOCUS INDICATOR */
	.btn:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #ff922b; outline-offset: 3px; }

	/* VEHICLE CARD */
	.vehicle-card { background: white; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 2rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
	h2 { color: #1a202c; margin-top: 0; }
	ul { padding-left: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0; }
	li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: #4a5568; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
	<main>
		<!-- WORK IN PROGRESS -->
		<div class="wip-banner">
			<span class="wip-badge">Work in Progress</span>
			<p>Our website is under construction. Launching premier Non-Emergency Medical Transportation (NEMT) across San Diego County soon!</p>
		</div>

		<!-- HERO BUSINESS ACCORD -->
		<section class="hero">
			<h1>San Diego Wheelchair & Ambulatory Medical Transport</h1>
			<p class="lead">Providing safe, reliable, door-through-door non-emergency medical transportation services for patients, families, and healthcare facilities.</p>
			<div class="cta-group">
				<a href="tel:6193177789" class="btn btn-primary">Call to Inquire: (619) 317-7789</a>
				<a href="mailto:jaravanmobilellc@gmail.com" class="btn btn-secondary">Email Our Team</a>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- PRESTIGE FLEET SECTION -->
		<section class="vehicle-card">
			<h2>Our Premium Fleet Asset</h2>
			<p>We proudly operate a <strong>2026 Toyota Sienna VMI Longcut</strong> hybrid minivan. </p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>ADA-Compliant Rear Entry:</strong> Low-angle ramp system ensures seamless, safe loading of wheelchairs, power scooters, and wide bariatric mobility devices.</li>
				<li><strong>Fully Certified Drivers:</strong> Every ride is operated by a driver trained in CPR, First Aid, and passenger assistance techniques.</li>
				<li><strong>Full Regional Coverage:</strong> Reliable transportation throughout San Diego County.</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
	</main>
</body>
</html>